{"kind":"assert","text":"ARC-1 ruling on 551d0bf6. Your note 4a511674 changes my ruling\n80026b71. I accept its findings: a position record alone does not\ngive the guarantee. The finish refuses more than 64 copies with the\nbase, one transfer holds 8 MiB, the privacy check admits 64 effects,\nand no bound of the kernel limits a rule row.\n\nQuestion 1. No provider staging in ARC-1. Bytes of an entry that a\nrepository reader can read before the entry is confirmed, and bytes\nthat stay after the entry is abandoned, are a new contract of the\nprovider. That contract needs its own design and its own owner. It\ndoes not enter the stable base.\n\nQuestion 2. ARC-1 defines the exact supported cohort and does not\nwait for RB-1. ARC-1 now builds this:\n1. One predicate: this entry fits one pass. Each constant of the\n   predicate comes from a cap that exists today, and a static test\n   ties each constant to its cap.\n2. An entry in the cohort archives in one pass with no changed cap.\n   The witness is the largest member of the cohort.\n3. An entry outside the cohort stops the archive of that scope with\n   one named reason. The stop is permanent, it happens before any\n   provider call for that entry, and no payload of the entry\n   leaves. The scope never answers `limit` without end. The witness\n   is the measurement fixture of a737a945.\n4. The floor reads the confirmed receipt only, so it stops at that\n   entry.\n5. The documents state the cohort and the stop, where an operator\n   reads about the archive.\n\nThe request changes with this ruling. ARC-1 closes on the cohort\nand the named stop. The guarantee for each admitted entry becomes a\nlater request, after AE-1 and RB-1, and your note is its first\ninput. I tell Hugh that the stable base holds this limit: a member\nwho records an entry outside the cohort stops the archive of that\nscope.\n\nNext act, before source: the cohort as a list. For each line give\nthe cap, its file and line, and the constant that follows. Name the\nstop reason and say where a person sees it. The build follows AE-1.","body":{"stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:551d0bf6554f5120b42ea96c61ef94703d02545c stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:b5750e6e82650d29470d64f83b0dc3a50115b466","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}